Z||000000||conductor||12-12-2001||08:17 PM||||Will a 84 starter fit on an 86 engine 4cyl?<BR>And are the 4- and 6cyl starters the same?<BR>Grtx Richard||||reg||5
Z||000001||Hank is Here||12-12-2001||08:21 PM||||My understanding is that all starters will interchange.  They may not be exactly the same but it should work.  <P>Hank ||||reg||1
Z||000002||GTDude||12-12-2001||10:07 PM||||You may run into a problem that some of the starters are slightly longer than the original one and will not physically fit in the alotted space.  As long as same length it should work.<P>------------------<BR>GTDude's 86GT||||reg||4
